=== v2.2 ===

    - This version simply corrects the couple MCI commands that WOULDN'T
      convert to 2.60/R1 format, even AFTER the UP250 program was used.

=== v2.1 ===

    - This version took care of a big SetUp problem. It seems I was using
      the "pfiles/" extension, instead of the "pfiles:" norm. This caused
      many initial setup problems for many users. This version was written
      to place the paths at the beginning of the file, and are stated only
      once, instead of wherever I happened to open a file in the game.
    - A small bug I noticed occurred when the hint option was enabled and
      you earned your first Pip. This bug was squashed beyond recognition!
    - The game file and the title picture seemed to have some of it's data
      corrupted. I'm not sure if these files were corrupted in a previous
      release, but I went through with a fine tooth comb and removed and
      replaced several altered sections of code. Seems to work fine now.

=== v2.0 ===

    - This version was the first version to incorporate the extensive
      documentative Arexx instruction file.
    - MCI's were converted to the new format C-Net used at the time.

=== v1.0 ===

    - First public release version of the game.
    - Documentation for this version was VERY sparse, and was one reason
      this game didn't get off the ground too much.

